  "description": {
    "raw": "You curse the target with a disfiguring or painful mutation. The target gains one random deformity from the Arcane Malignancies table (see page 10). The curse bestowed by this spell cannot be dispelled but can be removed with a break enchantment, limited wish, miracle, remove curse, or wish spell.",
